---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Imprint" description="Imprint and privacy for joseftot.com." cmd="cat imprint.txt">
  <h1>Imprint</h1>
  <div class="prose" style="margin-top:2rem">
    <h2>Disclosure (§ 25 MedienG)</h2>
    <p>
      Media owner and publisher: Josef Tot, <span class="ph">[PLACEHOLDER: town]</span>, Austria.<br />
      Contact: <span class="ph">[PLACEHOLDER: e-mail]</span><br />
      Purpose of this site: personal blog about IT and software development, and a showcase of my own projects.
    </p>
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This site sets no cookies and runs no tracking. Your theme choice, the command history of the prompt and your
      Space Invaders high score are stored only in your own browser (localStorage / sessionStorage) and never leave it.
      Fonts and scripts are served from this domain; nothing is loaded from third parties.
    </p>
    <p>The hosting provider processes technically necessary connection data (such as the IP address) to deliver the pages.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
